WEBVTT

01:27.745 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL "MY QUEEN"
BY XIE LOUNAN

01:38.625 --> 01:41.905
The realm's foundation
lies with a worthy heir.

01:41.985 --> 01:44.865
The peace of the four corners rests
on his rightful line.

01:45.465 --> 01:47.665
I rule all under heaven,

01:47.745 --> 01:50.025
bearing the enduring mandate
of the divinities,

01:50.105 --> 01:52.625
and the weight of all my people.

01:52.705 --> 01:55.465
Yet I am laid low by illness

01:55.545 --> 01:57.145
and my health has not returned.

01:57.225 --> 01:59.025
Remnant rebels still lurk,

01:59.105 --> 02:00.825
the Central Plains are racked by war,

02:00.905 --> 02:02.145
and the great affairs of war and state

02:02.225 --> 02:03.825
demand careful counsel and decision.

02:04.345 --> 02:07.385
Thus I appoint Prince
of Yuzhang, Xiao Qianqing,

02:07.905 --> 02:10.144
granting him power
over rewards and punishments,

02:10.225 --> 02:12.025
and entrusting him
with all military and state affairs.

02:12.745 --> 02:15.865
By this decree, he shall act as Regent.

02:26.105 --> 02:30.545
We'll do all we can
to assist Your Highness.

02:31.745 --> 02:33.425
I second that.

02:34.025 --> 02:35.665
His Majesty has spoken.

02:35.745 --> 02:37.745
I will serve as Regent for now.

02:38.785 --> 02:41.465
Ministers, do
you have any matters to report?

02:47.025 --> 02:48.665
Your Highness,

02:49.825 --> 02:50.665
some time ago,

02:50.745 --> 02:52.145
the Empress fell ill

02:52.665 --> 02:53.985
and went to
the imperial retreat to recover.

02:54.065 --> 02:55.625
But now,

02:55.705 --> 02:57.745
His Majesty is unwell as well.

02:58.505 --> 03:01.425
Ever since Her Majesty was enthroned,

03:01.505 --> 03:03.345
misfortunes have plagued the palace.

03:03.425 --> 03:08.145
I worry that when
their birth dates were matched,

03:08.705 --> 03:10.385
something may have gone wrong.

03:13.625 --> 03:14.465
You mean

03:14.545 --> 03:15.945
their birth charts don't match?

03:16.025 --> 03:17.545
Utter nonsense!

03:19.025 --> 03:21.265
His Majesty only fell ill

03:21.345 --> 03:23.785
from all these recent
disasters and troubles.

03:24.825 --> 03:26.465
It has nothing to do with the Empress.

03:27.545 --> 03:31.185
Minister Xing is deliberately
finding fault with Her Majesty.

03:31.265 --> 03:32.585
Such behavior is disrespectful!

03:34.745 --> 03:36.065
Please judge fairly, Your Highness.

03:38.585 --> 03:41.705
In matters this serious,
it's not my place to decide.

03:43.145 --> 03:45.625
Grand Tutor Ling, why
don't you ask His Majesty

03:46.145 --> 03:47.865
and look in on the Empress as well?

03:57.665 --> 03:58.745
Enough.

03:58.825 --> 04:01.065
This kind of talk ends here.

04:01.665 --> 04:04.905
I ask you all not to gossip idly
about the Emperor and Empress.

04:04.985 --> 04:06.465
Let us focus our minds on state affairs.

04:07.185 --> 04:10.945
Kumor's siege of Jiangzhou
has yet to be broken.

04:11.945 --> 04:12.985
Grand Tutor Ling,

04:13.745 --> 04:15.025
what do you think?

04:18.345 --> 04:19.384
I agree.

04:29.185 --> 04:31.105
Your Highness is absolutely right.

04:31.185 --> 04:32.945
The crisis in Jiangzhou
concerns the very foundation of our state.

04:33.025 --> 04:35.585
As for the second
batch of grain for Jiangzhou,

04:35.665 --> 04:38.305
I urge Your Highness to
send it out as soon as possible.

04:38.385 --> 04:40.825
-Yes.
-Indeed.

04:50.385 --> 04:52.665
How is the disaster situation in Xuzhou?

04:53.945 --> 04:55.425
I have received word

04:55.505 --> 04:57.465
that the locust plague
in Xuzhou is growing ever worse,

04:57.545 --> 05:00.225
and the relief grain is
but a drop in the bucket.

05:00.305 --> 05:03.425
The supplies we sent
earlier are nearly gone.

05:05.225 --> 05:07.305
Both Jiangzhou and Xuzhou

05:07.385 --> 05:08.665
are crying out for grain.

05:08.745 --> 05:10.185
What are we to do?

05:11.145 --> 05:12.905
They are all subjects of Great Qi.

05:14.625 --> 05:17.105
I am truly troubled by this.

05:19.745 --> 05:20.665
Eunuch Feng,

05:21.265 --> 05:22.665
my head aches terribly.

05:22.745 --> 05:24.265
Let us adjourn court for today.

05:24.345 --> 05:26.145
-We will discuss this another day.
-Yes, of course.

05:34.985 --> 05:37.385
We respectfully see Your Highness out.

05:43.345 --> 05:45.985
LING MANOR

05:53.545 --> 05:55.625
BRUSH AND INK

06:03.825 --> 06:05.425
It's one thing

06:05.505 --> 06:07.545
for Prince of Yuzhang
to throw his weight around,

06:07.625 --> 06:11.265
but what was he playing at in court today?

06:12.265 --> 06:14.745
He wouldn't even
release the grain for Jiangzhou,

06:14.825 --> 06:17.385
yet he deliberately steered
things to the locust plague in Xuzhou.

06:17.985 --> 06:19.625
The grain in the state granary

06:20.145 --> 06:21.865
was clearly raised

06:21.945 --> 06:24.385
by the Grand Tutor himself
from the grain merchants!

06:24.465 --> 06:25.305
Exactly.

06:25.385 --> 06:27.545
The military situation
in Jiangzhou is urgent.

06:27.625 --> 06:29.425
The border war concerns
the very foundation of the realm.

06:30.105 --> 06:32.625
The locust plague
in Xuzhou is an internal trouble at best.

06:32.705 --> 06:33.785
What matters most now

06:33.865 --> 06:37.025
is to secure
supplies for the border troops.

06:37.105 --> 06:38.225
Given how things stand,

06:38.305 --> 06:40.465
we might as well go
straight to His Majesty

06:40.545 --> 06:41.985
and lodge a complaint
against Prince of Yuzhang!

06:42.065 --> 06:43.265
-Yes!
-Exactly!

06:43.345 --> 06:44.425
Enough.

06:47.825 --> 06:50.905
As for the grain, I know what to do.

06:52.625 --> 06:54.185
It's getting late.

06:54.825 --> 06:56.785
Sirs, you may all retire.

07:12.385 --> 07:13.345
My Lord.

07:15.865 --> 07:17.745
You will depart for Xuzhou at once.

07:17.825 --> 07:19.465
Tell the Governor of Xuzhou

07:19.545 --> 07:22.665
that I've backed him every
step of the way to where he is now,

07:23.825 --> 07:27.105
and it's about time he repaid the favor.

07:28.305 --> 07:29.145
Yes, My Lord.

07:34.225 --> 07:36.665
I don't care what
the disaster in Xuzhou is really like.

07:37.545 --> 07:40.105
The report
that comes back to the Capital must say…

07:41.545 --> 07:43.225
the locust plague has passed.

07:44.385 --> 07:46.945
Send this to
the Governor of Xuzhou as well.

07:51.105 --> 07:52.185
At once, My Lord.

07:55.425 --> 07:57.385
A child playing at power?

08:00.305 --> 08:02.025
Xiao Qianqing,

08:02.105 --> 08:04.585
since you insist on
hearing about Xuzhou's disaster,

08:05.345 --> 08:07.425
I'll make sure you get an answer

08:09.145 --> 08:10.985
that you'll be pleased with.

08:14.505 --> 08:16.305
When you presided
over court as Regent today,

08:16.385 --> 08:17.745
did Ling Xuefeng give you a hard time?

08:18.745 --> 08:19.905
He wouldn't dare.

08:19.985 --> 08:21.545
I'm not as mild-tempered as my brother.

08:22.145 --> 08:23.945
If that old man ever tries to push me,

08:24.025 --> 08:24.865
I'll…

08:25.425 --> 08:26.505
I'll drive him mad.

08:29.505 --> 08:31.545
I never expected Xiao Huan

08:32.065 --> 08:34.024
to make a move like this.

08:34.904 --> 08:35.985
Making you Regent

08:36.585 --> 08:40.065
might be to pit you against Ling Xuefeng.

08:40.585 --> 08:45.145
Don't let yourself
be used as someone else's blade.

08:47.065 --> 08:48.025
He…

08:49.265 --> 08:50.585
really is seriously ill?

08:52.865 --> 08:53.825
When I saw him last night,

08:53.905 --> 08:55.785
he looked in terrible shape,

08:55.865 --> 08:56.985
like he might not make it.

08:58.825 --> 09:00.825
His retreat is sealed up tight.

09:00.905 --> 09:03.145
I can't get any of my people in at all.

09:03.665 --> 09:05.545
I truly don't know what game he's playing.

09:06.985 --> 09:09.585
Now he's dumped this mess on you.

09:10.305 --> 09:12.785
Is he hoping you'll stumble

09:12.865 --> 09:14.265
so he can send you back to Southern Chu?

09:14.985 --> 09:17.225
Then we'll see if
he really has that ability.

09:18.385 --> 09:19.905
My brother

09:19.985 --> 09:21.745
has always been deeply scheming.

09:22.465 --> 09:24.745
Every step he takes,

09:24.825 --> 09:25.905
he's already planned three moves ahead.

09:26.825 --> 09:27.985
It even exhausts me just watching him.

09:28.065 --> 09:29.905
But this time, I won't let
him lead me by the nose.

09:31.545 --> 09:34.065
All right, Mother,
let's not talk about him.

09:34.145 --> 09:36.785
How has Ying been lately?

09:38.145 --> 09:39.585
Get out!

09:39.665 --> 09:41.785
I told you I'm not eating!
Stop bothering me!

09:45.105 --> 09:46.185
Li Hongqing!

09:47.985 --> 09:48.945
You're here.

09:49.465 --> 09:50.385
Your Highness.

09:53.505 --> 09:54.865
What took you so long?

09:57.985 --> 09:59.025
Come with me.

09:59.105 --> 10:01.105
Look what I've prepared for you.

10:10.265 --> 10:13.105
I studied all kinds of
venomous snakes myself

10:13.185 --> 10:15.265
to make this jar of
powder that wards off every snake.

10:20.585 --> 10:21.665
Here, take it.

10:22.425 --> 10:23.265
Impressive, right?

10:25.385 --> 10:26.865
So Guard Wang Xiong

10:26.945 --> 10:29.025
almost lost his life

10:29.105 --> 10:30.665
because of this "research" of yours?

10:33.865 --> 10:35.345
He really was bitten by a venomous snake.

10:35.985 --> 10:37.745
How long will
you keep making trouble like this?

10:39.665 --> 10:41.225
Being a princess doesn't
mean you can do whatever you want

10:41.305 --> 10:42.185
and ignore other people's lives!

10:45.785 --> 10:46.945
I didn't.

10:47.985 --> 10:49.265
Have you forgotten?

10:49.345 --> 10:51.465
You ordered people
to lock him in with those snakes.

10:51.545 --> 10:52.865
He nearly died!

10:55.705 --> 10:58.585
But… he told me

10:58.665 --> 11:01.185
he grew up in the south
and wasn't afraid of snakes.

11:03.225 --> 11:04.585
And besides,

11:04.665 --> 11:06.545
I even gave him protection.

11:07.065 --> 11:08.545
I never meant to harm him.

11:09.865 --> 11:10.745
I didn't…

11:13.305 --> 11:14.865
I never wanted to hurt him.

11:15.785 --> 11:17.625
I never wanted to hurt him.

11:18.425 --> 11:19.825
It's you,

11:19.905 --> 11:21.025
all of you…

11:21.625 --> 11:23.105
You're the ones trying to hurt me,

11:23.905 --> 11:25.705
every last one of you!

11:28.145 --> 11:30.545
Only when you stand firm at court

11:30.625 --> 11:33.545
will Ying and I really have support.

11:33.625 --> 11:36.425
If we can get rid of
Ling Xuefeng while you're still Regent,

11:37.465 --> 11:38.385
even better.

11:39.345 --> 11:41.145
We have to seize this chance.

11:41.865 --> 11:43.585
The more serious the disaster becomes,

11:43.665 --> 11:45.425
the more it works in our favor.

11:45.505 --> 11:47.665
However,
we have to know where to draw the line.

11:54.305 --> 11:56.825
Your Majesty,
Eunuch Feng is waiting outside,

11:56.905 --> 11:59.505
urging His Highness to
review today's memorials.

12:03.305 --> 12:04.145
Understood.

12:06.905 --> 12:07.985
Mother,

12:08.065 --> 12:09.105
I'll take my leave.

12:19.305 --> 12:21.385
XUANGUANG GATE

12:26.785 --> 12:27.985
Greetings, Your Highness.

12:28.505 --> 12:29.585
Your Highness,

12:29.665 --> 12:31.345
it's getting late.

12:31.425 --> 12:33.625
Should we move to Wuying Hall now?

12:33.705 --> 12:35.265
What's the rush?

12:36.065 --> 12:38.185
These memorials will never run out.

12:38.865 --> 12:39.945
Let's just wait a little longer.

12:40.625 --> 12:41.585
Your Highness,

12:41.665 --> 12:42.505
how about this?

12:42.585 --> 12:45.385
If there's anything you need done,
I can handle it for you.

12:46.145 --> 12:47.185
Oh?

12:47.265 --> 12:48.905
I'm going to visit my sister.

12:48.985 --> 12:50.305
Can you do that in my place as well?

12:50.825 --> 12:53.225
I wouldn't dare. But…

12:53.305 --> 12:54.745
Just give me a moment.

12:54.825 --> 12:56.185
Once I've checked on my sister,

12:56.265 --> 12:58.705
I'll dutifully go through the memorials.
All right?

13:01.305 --> 13:02.905
Why not find someone to haul me back?

13:02.985 --> 13:05.145
Your Highness. Listen, Your Highness…

13:31.545 --> 13:32.385
Qianqing!

13:34.025 --> 13:36.185
These are all new
poisons I cooked up in secret.

13:36.265 --> 13:37.945
When you have time,

13:38.625 --> 13:39.905
try them out on Xiao Huan!

13:44.785 --> 13:45.745
Ying,

13:46.585 --> 13:47.985
you need to behave.

13:48.065 --> 13:48.905
Promise me,

13:49.545 --> 13:52.105
don't hurt people with poison anymore,

13:52.185 --> 13:53.025
all right?

13:59.945 --> 14:01.025
Why?

14:06.385 --> 14:08.265
Do you all think

14:08.345 --> 14:09.985
I'll end up killing someone?

14:11.425 --> 14:13.145
I never meant to hurt anyone.

14:13.945 --> 14:15.025
Except Xiao Huan,

14:15.105 --> 14:17.105
I've never wanted to hurt anyone else.

14:18.505 --> 14:19.585
You have to believe me.

14:19.665 --> 14:21.745
I do. Of course I believe you.

14:23.025 --> 14:25.705
You're so kind. How could
you possibly want to hurt anyone?

14:26.585 --> 14:29.065
Guard Wang was poisoned by that snake.
It clearly wasn't my fault,

14:30.505 --> 14:32.745
yet Li Hongqing is still angry.

14:33.265 --> 14:35.705
He blames me, and I'm not happy about it.

14:37.385 --> 14:38.345
Then,

14:38.425 --> 14:39.905
let's drag Li Hongqing over here

14:39.985 --> 14:41.025
and teach him a lesson.

14:41.745 --> 14:44.945
Better not.
I won't lower myself to his level.

14:56.025 --> 14:57.305
You like him?

15:00.985 --> 15:04.025
Then if we drag Li Hongqing over
and make him my brother-in-law,

15:04.105 --> 15:05.025
that wouldn't be so bad.

15:05.105 --> 15:06.465
I don't like him at all.

15:08.945 --> 15:09.825
How about this?

15:10.345 --> 15:12.505
I'll bring him here
and make him apologize to you.

15:12.585 --> 15:13.625
What do you think?

15:15.345 --> 15:16.465
Really?

15:17.025 --> 15:18.905
When have I ever lied to you?

15:40.825 --> 15:43.185
If you could stay this simple and happy

15:43.265 --> 15:44.825
and keep living in your own little world,

15:44.905 --> 15:46.825
it might be a blessing in its own way.

15:47.545 --> 15:49.465
Without facing people's tangled schemes,

15:50.105 --> 15:51.985
you wouldn't be hurt even more.

15:57.465 --> 15:59.745
Your Highness, time's up.

15:59.825 --> 16:01.665
You need to go back
and review the memorials.

16:07.305 --> 16:08.345
Ying,

16:09.825 --> 16:11.345
time's almost up.

16:11.425 --> 16:12.785
I have to go.

16:12.865 --> 16:14.105
I'll come see you next time.

16:18.185 --> 16:19.305
Qianqing.

16:21.065 --> 16:24.105
Could you give me some silver?

16:24.945 --> 16:26.345
What do you need silver for?

16:26.425 --> 16:27.265
I need it.

16:28.785 --> 16:30.385
For something very important!

16:53.745 --> 16:54.585
Your Majesty,

16:55.185 --> 16:56.265
did you sleep well?

17:00.345 --> 17:02.145
I prepared this especially for you.

17:02.785 --> 17:03.825
Have a taste.

17:07.625 --> 17:09.184
I stole your grain,

17:09.704 --> 17:11.105
yet now you are letting bygones be bygones

17:12.585 --> 17:13.944
and treating me like an honored guest?

17:15.825 --> 17:17.105
That's a separate matter.

17:17.905 --> 17:19.464
You robbed my grain,

17:19.545 --> 17:21.505
and I almost used you as
an offering to rally my troops.

17:22.105 --> 17:23.825
The supplies are already on their way.

17:26.145 --> 17:28.464
You won't so much as shake me.

17:42.465 --> 17:43.305
Your Majesty,

17:43.825 --> 17:44.665
please.

17:52.585 --> 17:54.705
Then I won't stand on ceremony.

18:00.745 --> 18:02.025
Please enjoy, Your Majesty.

18:02.585 --> 18:04.225
I told you, I'm not the Empress.

18:07.465 --> 18:09.145
You're not the Empress?

18:09.945 --> 18:11.265
Then who are you?

18:11.785 --> 18:13.745
My surname is Lin, L-i-n.
I'm Lin Cangcang.

18:15.305 --> 18:16.305
Then how do you explain…

18:20.105 --> 18:21.585
this Phoenix Seal?

18:35.105 --> 18:37.545
-I stole it.
-You stole it?

18:42.745 --> 18:44.265
The Phoenix Seal belongs to the Empress.

18:44.865 --> 18:47.425
It's kept safe deep in the palace.

18:47.945 --> 18:48.985
How did you steal it?

18:50.185 --> 18:51.185
With my skills,

18:51.265 --> 18:52.905
stealing it was child's play.

18:52.985 --> 18:54.265
What's so strange about that?

18:54.985 --> 18:57.385
But, of all the things you could steal,

18:57.465 --> 18:58.945
why steal the Phoenix Seal?

19:02.385 --> 19:03.585
Well,

19:04.105 --> 19:05.385
that's a long story.

19:06.065 --> 19:07.105
No rush.

19:08.665 --> 19:10.065
I've got

19:10.145 --> 19:11.465
plenty of time.

19:18.105 --> 19:19.745
Have you heard of the Lingbi Sect?

19:20.345 --> 19:21.345
Heard of it.

19:21.425 --> 19:22.865
It's pretty famous.

19:23.665 --> 19:27.185
They say the Lingbi Sect leader's token
ended up in the Emperor's hands.

19:27.265 --> 19:28.985
That's actually what I went in to steal.

19:29.065 --> 19:29.905
But somehow,

19:30.865 --> 19:32.265
I ended up with this thing instead.

19:34.185 --> 19:35.825
Then why did you join the army?

19:36.945 --> 19:38.505
Pure coincidence.

19:38.585 --> 19:41.025
I left the palace in armor,
ran into the reinforcements heading west,

19:41.105 --> 19:42.385
and they brought me out of the city.

19:43.745 --> 19:45.865
You really took the long way around.

19:47.345 --> 19:48.345
And you just slipped into

19:48.425 --> 19:49.905
-the reinforcements like that?
-Is it impossible?

19:51.185 --> 19:52.225
Sure, it's possible.

19:53.105 --> 19:55.905
But from the Capital to
Jiangzhou is a long road.

19:56.425 --> 19:58.225
Why didn't you run off on the way?

19:58.305 --> 19:59.465
Why would I run?

19:59.545 --> 20:01.665
There's food in the army,
and the marching isn't hard.

20:01.745 --> 20:02.985
Besides,

20:03.065 --> 20:04.825
once I got here, I even earned merit.

20:04.905 --> 20:06.665
So why not wait till I get my pay?

20:07.665 --> 20:08.505
Sure,

20:09.625 --> 20:10.505
keep spinning your story.

20:11.305 --> 20:13.705
You really think I would believe

20:13.785 --> 20:15.545
that pack of nonsense?

20:23.705 --> 20:24.705
Suit yourself,

20:25.225 --> 20:26.265
believe it or don't.

20:36.385 --> 20:37.505
Kuminjia,

20:38.025 --> 20:40.745
for a dignified princess to
use such dirty tricks to catch me

20:40.825 --> 20:42.105
is hardly an honorable win.

20:42.185 --> 20:43.825
You robbed my grain first.

20:43.905 --> 20:45.345
If we're talking dirty tricks,

20:45.425 --> 20:46.705
I can't hold a candle to you.

20:47.265 --> 20:48.785
And now you're trying to goad me?

20:48.865 --> 20:49.985
I'm not falling for it.

20:50.785 --> 20:51.705
Fine by me,

20:51.785 --> 20:53.105
saves me the trouble.

20:53.785 --> 20:55.945
I've lived rough as a wandering thief.

20:56.025 --> 20:58.065
Being kept here with good food

20:58.145 --> 20:59.265
isn't such a bad deal.

21:00.185 --> 21:02.865
Your Majesty,
you really do know how to joke.

21:02.945 --> 21:04.705
I told you, I'm not the Empress.

21:04.785 --> 21:07.105
What, does the great commander of Xijiang

21:07.185 --> 21:10.025
really have to use
the Empress to threaten Great Qi?

21:12.305 --> 21:14.025
You've been besieging Jiangzhou City

21:14.105 --> 21:15.985
for over a month already

21:16.065 --> 21:17.025
and still haven't taken it.

21:18.305 --> 21:20.425
No wonder you're turning to shady tricks.

21:22.265 --> 21:23.345
Your Majesty,

21:23.865 --> 21:26.465
provoking me like that won't work at all.

21:28.385 --> 21:30.345
I'm just stating the facts.

21:33.825 --> 21:35.545
You stay calm even in danger,

21:36.985 --> 21:38.945
truly impressive.

21:41.025 --> 21:42.145
Ling Jueding just sent word:

21:43.105 --> 21:44.185
in five days,

21:44.265 --> 21:47.265
Great Qi's envoys will
come to make peace with me.

21:47.785 --> 21:51.705
Who you really are
will be clear soon enough.

21:59.945 --> 22:00.865
All right then.

22:16.345 --> 22:18.185
You really are quite something.

22:19.665 --> 22:20.585
What a pity.

22:21.785 --> 22:22.825
A pity about what?

22:23.505 --> 22:25.305
Pity you're a woman.

22:25.385 --> 22:29.105
Otherwise,
I might have taken pity on your looks,

22:29.185 --> 22:31.665
begged my brother to spare your life,
and kept you for my own amusement.

22:34.865 --> 22:37.145
You should come to Great Qi instead.

22:37.665 --> 22:39.225
Great Qi is vast and rich.

22:39.305 --> 22:40.825
If there's one thing we never lack,

22:40.905 --> 22:43.345
it's fine men everywhere.

22:43.425 --> 22:45.065
You'd love it there.

22:46.305 --> 22:48.625
Quit trying to fool me.
Just sit tight and behave!

23:00.185 --> 23:01.025
Everyone,

23:01.985 --> 23:03.545
let's rest up while we can

23:04.065 --> 23:05.345
and be ready to move at any time.

23:05.425 --> 23:06.265
Yes, Sir!

23:16.545 --> 23:17.625
Greetings, Madam.

23:18.345 --> 23:20.985
May I ask why you summoned me, Madam?

23:22.025 --> 23:23.505
General Lu Qi,

23:24.065 --> 23:26.065
at the Qingyu Guard's marching speed,

23:26.585 --> 23:28.465
how long until we reach Jiangzhou?

23:29.825 --> 23:30.785
Madam,

23:31.865 --> 23:34.505
this time our escort is
under a hundred riders,

23:34.585 --> 23:35.545
mostly light cavalry.

23:36.265 --> 23:40.145
If we push day and night,
we can be in Jiangzhou in three days.

23:45.545 --> 23:48.025
Then please pass the order:

23:48.665 --> 23:51.825
rest tomorrow and depart the day
after tomorrow at midmorning.

23:53.665 --> 23:55.625
Madam, why is that?

23:56.225 --> 23:57.745
The enemy's
momentum hits hardest the first time,

23:58.305 --> 24:00.505
weaker the second, gone the third.

24:01.825 --> 24:03.465
The more we rush,

24:03.985 --> 24:05.825
the more we play right into Kumor's hands.

24:07.545 --> 24:08.665
Let him wait.

24:10.345 --> 24:11.865
Wear down his edge.

24:12.945 --> 24:16.145
He'll calm down
and make peace with Great Qi.

24:17.465 --> 24:21.665
But… I've heard one of our men
has been taken hostage by Kumor.

24:21.745 --> 24:23.305
That man is vital to us.

24:23.385 --> 24:24.985
Precisely because of that,

24:26.145 --> 24:27.305
this is what we must do.

24:31.705 --> 24:32.865
Trust me, General Lu.

24:36.105 --> 24:38.345
His Majesty personally
chose the Qingyu Guard to escort you.

24:39.505 --> 24:41.745
We'll naturally follow your lead.

24:51.345 --> 24:52.225
Ling Cangcang,

24:52.745 --> 24:54.145
don't blame me for being ruthless.

24:54.665 --> 24:56.625
Everything I do is for Great Qi.

24:57.865 --> 25:00.305
Since Kumor is betting
that you're the Empress of Great Qi,

25:00.825 --> 25:04.345
if I arrive a few days late,
he still won't dare lay a finger on you.

25:40.385 --> 25:41.745
Your Highness.

26:12.705 --> 26:13.745
Your Highness,

26:13.825 --> 26:16.945
it's time for you
to review the memorials now.

26:17.025 --> 26:19.625
Aren't I reading them right now?
Why in such a hurry?

26:20.225 --> 26:23.905
Still, Your Highness,
you're holding that memorial upside down.

26:31.185 --> 26:32.505
What are you laughing at, Your Highness?

26:33.065 --> 26:35.745
At how unlikeable my
imperial brother's face is.

26:35.825 --> 26:38.505
The ministers are
all hoping he'll die soon.

26:38.585 --> 26:39.425
Your Highness,

26:39.945 --> 26:43.345
you can't say such treasonous things
so carelessly.

26:43.425 --> 26:44.545
Look at this one:

26:44.625 --> 26:46.705
the prefect specially
memorializes the throne,

26:47.225 --> 26:49.345
saying it's been warm with little rain,

26:49.425 --> 26:51.665
so this year's
lychees will be a bumper crop

26:51.745 --> 26:52.945
and delicious, too.

26:54.265 --> 26:55.305
And this one:

26:55.865 --> 26:57.665
"I am asking after Your Majesty's health."

26:58.785 --> 27:00.945
All these pointless memorials

27:01.025 --> 27:02.945
are enough to work
my poor brother to death.

27:03.025 --> 27:06.105
Your Highness,
that's their way of showing loyalty.

27:08.145 --> 27:10.945
Being emperor
really isn't a job for any normal person.

27:11.545 --> 27:13.065
I see that now.

27:13.585 --> 27:15.345
My imperial brother
dumped the burden on me

27:15.425 --> 27:17.585
just to make me do
all the hard labor for him.

27:18.305 --> 27:19.225
Your Highness,

27:21.345 --> 27:22.865
please watch your tongue!

27:22.945 --> 27:25.945
All right, drop the act.

27:26.465 --> 27:28.025
When my brother comes back,

27:28.105 --> 27:31.065
your old bones will
be worn out from kneeling.

27:31.145 --> 27:31.985
LOCAL LOCUST CONTROL
IS ALREADY SHOWING RESULTS.

27:32.065 --> 27:32.905
NO GRAIN SHORTAGES OR UNREST ARE REPORTED.

27:32.985 --> 27:33.905
THE LOCUST PLAGUE
IS EXPECTED TO BE RESOLVED SOON.

27:37.505 --> 27:39.625
Your Highness, why are you laughing again?

27:40.665 --> 27:42.545
The Governor of Xuzhou reports

27:42.625 --> 27:44.465
that the authorities acted in time,

27:44.545 --> 27:46.025
the locust plague is
no longer a real threat,

27:46.105 --> 27:48.345
and the people are not short of grain.

27:49.865 --> 27:51.905
Looks like our Grand Tutor Ling

27:51.985 --> 27:53.465
is quite efficient.

27:54.745 --> 27:56.825
All right. I'm tired.

27:56.905 --> 27:59.385
I'm going to the hot
spring retreat to relax.

27:59.465 --> 28:01.065
Tell Li Hongqing:

28:01.145 --> 28:03.305
If you want me to
keep reviewing memorials,

28:03.385 --> 28:05.025
he'll have to come invite me himself.

28:05.105 --> 28:07.025
Your Highness, oh…

28:08.065 --> 28:09.585
Your Highness…

28:52.585 --> 28:53.625
Carry on with your patrol.

28:54.465 --> 28:55.825
Commander Li!

28:55.905 --> 28:57.105
Commander Li!

28:57.785 --> 28:59.865
Please wait, Commander Li.

29:01.465 --> 29:03.425
-What can I do for you, Eunuch Feng?
-Commander Li,

29:03.505 --> 29:05.705
I'd like to ask you a favor.

29:06.265 --> 29:08.105
-I'm not going to the cold palace again.
-No…

29:08.625 --> 29:11.705
Commander Li, this time,
it's not to see Princess Ying.

29:12.305 --> 29:15.385
This time we need
you to fetch Prince of Yuzhang.

29:16.905 --> 29:18.385
-Prince of Yuzhang?
-Yes.

29:18.985 --> 29:21.705
Prince of Yuzhang
is off soaking in hot springs,

29:21.785 --> 29:25.225
with a pile of memorials
still waiting for his review.

29:25.305 --> 29:26.745
Then get someone to drag him back.

29:26.825 --> 29:27.745
Why come to me?

29:28.465 --> 29:29.425
Commander Li,

29:29.505 --> 29:31.145
who is Prince of Yuzhang?

29:31.745 --> 29:34.025
He's not someone just anyone can summon.

29:34.105 --> 29:37.825
He already said
that if we want him back at the palace,

29:38.705 --> 29:40.505
Commander Li

29:41.025 --> 29:42.305
must go in person.

29:42.385 --> 29:46.065
Please, do a good deed today
and save this old servant.

29:49.305 --> 29:51.425
Those siblings really are troublesome.

29:51.985 --> 29:55.385
Tell me about it.
Commander Li, thank you for this!

30:24.185 --> 30:26.025
Who… who's there?

30:30.905 --> 30:32.145
You're here.

30:32.225 --> 30:33.425
In the middle of the night,

30:33.505 --> 30:35.065
you called me here
just to watch you bathe?

30:36.465 --> 30:37.825
Naturally, I have serious business.

30:40.345 --> 30:43.665
Right now, for me, only Cangcang's
whereabouts count as serious business.

30:44.265 --> 30:45.505
If it's not about her,

30:45.585 --> 30:46.865
we're done talking.

30:47.945 --> 30:50.545
Zhong Lin, you're breaking our deal.

30:52.345 --> 30:53.905
Your Highness, that's not fair!

30:54.545 --> 30:56.425
I've been pretending to
be Song Lanxi for so long.

30:56.505 --> 30:57.505
I've done plenty for you!

30:57.585 --> 31:00.305
Now, on the surface,
Cangcang is said to be at the retreat,

31:00.385 --> 31:01.265
but in truth,

31:01.345 --> 31:02.225
no one knows where she is!

31:02.825 --> 31:03.825
There has to be more to it.

31:04.865 --> 31:06.185
Miss Zhong,

31:06.945 --> 31:08.225
help me one more time,

31:08.305 --> 31:09.385
and I promise…

31:09.465 --> 31:11.505
Your promises are worthless.

31:46.665 --> 31:47.705
Your Highness.

31:50.145 --> 31:50.985
Down…

31:51.065 --> 31:52.065
Get down! Down!

31:52.145 --> 31:53.065
Quick!

32:03.025 --> 32:04.065
Your Highness,

32:04.665 --> 32:06.865
I was sent by Eunuch Feng
to bring you back to the palace.

32:08.625 --> 32:11.465
What's the rush? Wait outside.

32:11.545 --> 32:13.225
Once I've had my fill of soaking,

32:13.305 --> 32:14.505
I'll go out on my own.

32:23.945 --> 32:26.025
Then I'll stand right here
until you do, Your Highness.

32:26.105 --> 32:26.985
Insolent!

32:27.585 --> 32:28.865
How am I supposed to get out

32:31.905 --> 32:33.105
with you standing there?

32:33.185 --> 32:34.065
Just… turn around.

32:35.265 --> 32:36.105
Yes, Your Highness.

33:00.265 --> 33:01.265
Commander Li,

33:01.345 --> 33:03.305
are you really going
to stand there and watch?

33:16.865 --> 33:17.705
You…

33:18.305 --> 33:21.505
-you actually slapped me in the face!
-And I meant every slap.

33:21.585 --> 33:22.905
Shameless!

33:26.185 --> 33:27.105
-Miss Zhong.
-Let go!

33:27.185 --> 33:28.625
-Miss Zhong.
-Let go of me!

34:01.065 --> 34:02.265
I'm leaving.

34:02.785 --> 34:04.105
Wait!

34:04.185 --> 34:05.025
Miss…

34:05.785 --> 34:06.785
Miss Zhong…

34:07.945 --> 34:09.585
Vice Sect Leader Zhong…

34:09.665 --> 34:11.145
Sect Leader Zhong!

34:13.185 --> 34:14.385
I'm begging you.

34:14.465 --> 34:17.824
-Please go to Xuzhou in my place.
-Not going!

34:19.905 --> 34:21.225
The locust plague in Xuzhou

34:21.304 --> 34:23.025
is getting worse by the day.

34:23.105 --> 34:24.304
Grand Tutor Ling
and the Governor of Xuzhou

34:24.385 --> 34:26.945
have joined hands to hide the truth there.

34:27.545 --> 34:29.905
They are forcing me to
send grain to Jiangzhou.

34:32.065 --> 34:33.585
What does that have to do with me?

34:34.185 --> 34:36.225
I came to
the Capital to look for Cangcang.

34:36.304 --> 34:37.665
Now she's vanished without a trace.

34:37.744 --> 34:38.824
Why would I run off to Xuzhou?

34:42.304 --> 34:44.985
What's happening in Xuzhou
affects Ling Cangcang's safety.

34:45.824 --> 34:46.784
What do you mean?

34:47.824 --> 34:48.985
Fine, I'll be honest with you.

34:49.784 --> 34:51.905
Ling Cangcang is in Jiangzhou,

34:52.585 --> 34:54.385
and Xiao Huan has already gone after her.

34:54.465 --> 34:56.264
So Ling Cangcang's safety

34:56.344 --> 34:57.905
isn't yours to worry about.

34:58.585 --> 35:01.465
But the disaster in Xuzhou
is tied to Jiangzhou's crisis.

35:02.065 --> 35:03.665
Only by easing Xuzhou's troubles

35:03.745 --> 35:05.545
can we save Jiangzhou.

35:07.345 --> 35:08.905
What kind of nonsense is that?

35:09.425 --> 35:10.905
Are you telling
bedtime stories to kids now?

35:10.985 --> 35:13.345
I… what do I gain by lying to you?

35:14.625 --> 35:15.945
Who knows.

35:16.025 --> 35:18.065
Miss Zhong…

35:18.145 --> 35:19.385
Zhong Lin!

35:19.465 --> 35:21.505
You really don't care
about the people of Xuzhou?

35:21.585 --> 35:24.065
Why did you found the Fenglai Pavilion?

35:25.905 --> 35:27.905
All that talk about justice
and punishing evil,

35:27.985 --> 35:29.865
just empty talk?

35:42.705 --> 35:44.105
Say it. What do you want me to do?

35:46.465 --> 35:49.745
Go to Xuzhou and get a written
confession from the Governor there.

36:01.585 --> 36:02.865
It's a deal.

36:04.985 --> 36:06.105
Wait!

36:06.185 --> 36:07.225
Now what?

36:08.265 --> 36:09.545
Put this on.

36:09.625 --> 36:10.465
Do it quickly.

36:10.545 --> 36:14.025
My life and everything I have
are in your hands now.

36:25.705 --> 36:26.545
Your Highness,

36:28.465 --> 36:30.225
will you return to the palace with me now?

36:31.745 --> 36:32.785
No rush.

36:34.065 --> 36:38.505
Lately, I've had an annoying matter,
and I'm in no mood at all.

36:39.185 --> 36:42.025
When I'm in a mood like this,
I simply can't review memorials.

36:42.625 --> 36:45.665
I wonder if you can help ease my mind.

36:46.465 --> 36:47.305
Please speak.

36:50.105 --> 36:51.505
I went to see Ying.

36:52.305 --> 36:54.025
She was heartbroken.

36:55.145 --> 36:56.665
After asking around,

36:56.745 --> 36:59.425
I learned
that it had something to do with you.

37:03.425 --> 37:04.945
What would you have me do?

37:05.465 --> 37:07.625
Ying may not be in her right mind

37:07.705 --> 37:09.065
and sometimes seems unhinged,

37:09.825 --> 37:10.905
but deep down

37:10.985 --> 37:13.545
she's kinder and more innocent

37:13.625 --> 37:15.345
than anyone else in the harem.

37:15.425 --> 37:17.665
So whatever happens,

37:17.745 --> 37:20.705
I will always
believe her without question.

37:21.225 --> 37:22.665
She would never harm the innocent.

37:26.705 --> 37:27.745
Then I misjudged the Princess.

37:32.585 --> 37:35.865
Ying approaches feelings differently
from most people.

37:36.545 --> 37:37.985
The purer she is,

37:38.065 --> 37:40.185
the more easily she's
hurt by those she cares about.

37:41.585 --> 37:42.945
As her brother,

37:44.425 --> 37:46.865
I don't want to see her in pain.

37:50.385 --> 37:52.225
You started this.

37:53.585 --> 37:56.705
There's a way
for you to make it up to her.

37:58.265 --> 37:59.345
Go find her

37:59.865 --> 38:02.465
and do whatever it takes to cheer her up.

38:02.985 --> 38:06.865
If you succeed, I might just
force myself to finish the memorials.

38:08.785 --> 38:09.625
What do you say?

38:11.385 --> 38:14.265
It was my fault
for misunderstanding the Princess.

38:14.865 --> 38:15.825
I should apologize.

38:20.785 --> 38:22.065
When will you go?

38:23.465 --> 38:24.825
I'll go right now.

39:18.185 --> 39:19.305
Li Hongqing!

39:25.345 --> 39:26.385
You're here.

39:27.945 --> 39:29.985
Your Highness, I'm sorry.
I misunderstood you before.

39:32.905 --> 39:34.145
This is for you.

39:36.145 --> 39:37.025
Your Highness,

39:38.105 --> 39:39.425
what do you mean by this?

39:41.145 --> 39:43.305
Please give it to Guard Wang for me.

39:43.985 --> 39:45.825
He may have lied to me first,

39:45.905 --> 39:48.665
but he was poisoned because of me.

39:48.745 --> 39:50.185
So, I ought to make it up to him.

39:53.465 --> 39:56.505
This silver is from my brother.

39:56.585 --> 39:58.225
He didn't bring much that day.

39:59.185 --> 40:00.665
And this,

40:00.745 --> 40:01.785
also this…

40:02.785 --> 40:05.345
These are all my favorite things.

40:08.585 --> 40:09.865
On Guard Wang's behalf,

40:10.385 --> 40:11.425
thank you, Your Highness.

40:12.305 --> 40:13.465
Think nothing of it.

40:25.985 --> 40:28.705
Then can you stop
being mad at me from now on?

40:30.385 --> 40:32.065
If you want me to do something

40:32.145 --> 40:33.385
or not do something,

40:33.465 --> 40:35.225
you can just tell me directly.

40:35.305 --> 40:36.425
I'll listen to you.

40:37.825 --> 40:40.265
You don't have to listen to anyone.

40:40.785 --> 40:41.865
Just follow your own heart.

40:45.545 --> 40:47.665
There are rights and wrongs

40:48.185 --> 40:50.105
I can't always tell apart.

40:52.305 --> 40:53.825
But I trust you.

40:54.345 --> 40:55.425
You'll know the difference.

40:56.425 --> 40:57.385
Your Highness,

40:58.065 --> 40:59.025
why do you trust me so much?

41:06.065 --> 41:07.505
You think I don't remember?

41:08.785 --> 41:11.545
Back when the Crown Prince's Hall
caught fire, you saved me.

41:12.145 --> 41:15.465
You used this arm
to shield me from a falling burning beam.

41:17.305 --> 41:19.265
I thought
Your Highness had long forgotten.

41:19.345 --> 41:20.745
Of course I remember!

41:21.425 --> 41:22.785
Before that imperial
physician took me away,

41:22.865 --> 41:24.665
I bit you hard on the arm,

41:24.745 --> 41:27.065
so I could find you again one day.

41:31.265 --> 41:35.065
Then when did you realize
I was the guard who saved you?

41:39.505 --> 41:40.465
I'm not telling you.

41:42.145 --> 41:43.585
But since I've found you,

41:43.665 --> 41:44.825
I'll definitely treat you well.

41:46.705 --> 41:48.545
It's simply our duty
as the Imperial Guard.

41:48.625 --> 41:49.585
Don't trouble yourself over it.

41:51.265 --> 41:52.225
I don't care.

41:52.865 --> 41:54.585
If I say I'll treat you well,

41:55.745 --> 41:56.585
then I'll treat you well.

42:09.825 --> 42:13.145
Since the disaster
in Xuzhou is under control,

42:13.665 --> 42:14.905
I ask Your Highness

42:15.425 --> 42:17.705
to release the grain
for Jiangzhou as soon as possible.

42:18.625 --> 42:21.025
Once the Ministry of
Revenue finishes counting the grain

42:21.105 --> 42:22.825
and I've checked it,

42:23.345 --> 42:24.585
I'll naturally issue it.

42:24.665 --> 42:25.865
The war is pressing.

42:25.945 --> 42:27.385
We must not deliberately delay.

42:27.985 --> 42:30.145
I hope Your Highness
will give the order today.

42:33.785 --> 42:35.065
Deliberately?

42:35.145 --> 42:37.905
That's quite the crime
you're pinning on me.

42:37.985 --> 42:39.345
Why don't you go ask His Majesty himself

42:39.425 --> 42:40.785
how he plans to punish me?

42:41.545 --> 42:42.385
Your Highness…

42:46.025 --> 42:48.105
Then may I ask,

42:48.185 --> 42:50.385
how many more days do you expect

42:50.465 --> 42:51.505
this grain counting to take?

42:52.425 --> 42:54.465
Seven or eight days at least.

42:54.545 --> 42:56.345
Rest easy, Grand Tutor Ling.

42:56.425 --> 42:59.705
When Preceptor Du left the Capital,
she took plenty of grain with her.

42:59.785 --> 43:01.665
That will ease
Jiangzhou's immediate crisis.

43:01.745 --> 43:03.865
That only buys us time!

43:04.625 --> 43:05.705
I sincerely beg Your Highness

43:05.785 --> 43:07.705
to release the second
batch as soon as possible.

43:09.625 --> 43:11.745
Jiangzhou is a key fortress,

43:11.825 --> 43:13.945
and the war allows no delay.

43:14.025 --> 43:15.905
Three days from now,

43:16.825 --> 43:19.905
I will await Your Highness's grain order.
